Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(e2e): gate the map's gestures and route readability,
 with per-node kills

Three nodes: the camera must actually move under a real pointer drag and Ctrl+wheel,
the route must carry more than one feature and be styled by mode and zoom, and the
gesture split must be stated on the panel rather than left to be discovered.

Six of the seven mutants are killed, each by a mutant of its own node's shape;
kill-b survived for a measured reason -- the provider's geometry already carries
properties.mode -- and review/ORD-0037-kill-evidence.md records that as a known gap
instead of a pass.
